<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="Alisher's apps" pubkey="" timestamp="1786039449" url="https://xalisher.github.io/fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>Private, self-hosted Android apps on Logos — no Google, no accounts, no central server. Peers: a peer-to-peer messenger over Logos, MeshCore (LoRa) and Bluetooth mesh, end-to-end and at-rest encrypted. Booth &amp; Receiver: broadcast and tune in to decentralised anonymous radio over Tor + Logos Messaging.</description></repo><application id="com.boothandroid"><id>com.boothandroid</id><added>2026-07-06</added><lastupdated>2026-07-06</lastupdated><name>Booth</name><summary>Broadcast a decentralised anonymous radio station</summary><desc>Broadcast a decentralised, anonymous radio station from your phone: create a
